{"resourceIdentifier":"2516","resourceName":"Lianyuan LFG Power Generation Project","description":"Lianyuan LFG Power Generation Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) is located at the Lianyuan Fuhong landfill in Lianyuan city, Hunan province, P.R China. The purpose of the project is to utilize landfill gas (LFG), which consists mainly of methane, for electricity generation. It includes LFG collection system, LFG pre-treatment system and electricity generation system. LFG collected will be used for electricity generation with internal combustion generators. The total installed capacity will be 1.067MW. The project started construction on 06-August-2020  and operated on 01-January-2021.\r\nIn absence of the project, equivalent amount of electricity exported to the grid by the project would have otherwise been supplied by Central China Power Grid (CCPG). Greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions will be reduced by avoiding CO2 emissions from those fossil fuel-based power plants connected to the grid and by avoiding GHG emissions from releasing LFG into atmosphere at the landfill site.","location":{"latitude":27.745553,"longitude":111.687500},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-07-02","endExclusive":"2021-08-02","endInclusive":"2021-08-01"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2516"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hunan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Lianyuan Xinzhongshui Environmental Protection Technology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Hunan Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2516"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"40563"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.G."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"China Classification Society Certification Company (CCSC)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"04/03/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/01/2021 - 31/12/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=52520&IDKEY=3iofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3972425080","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"01-Lianyuan_VCS PD draft.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-05-06T15:52:43.91Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=52522&IDKEY=s98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8ds72427838","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"03-Lianyuan_VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-05-06T15:54:08.43Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=62795&IDKEY=f097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87986594305","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"LianyuanVCSJointPDMR.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-03-04T14:17:24.33Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=57485&IDKEY=n097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87d79271815","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"05-Lianyuan_VCS-Registration-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-11-02T12:36:55.643Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=62797&IDKEY=0q934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhd86597063","document